 - (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5340+) Added a new **Sevopedia Builds** category (e.g. **"Remove Jungle"**, **Chop Down a Forest**, **"Scrub Fallout"**, **"Build a Road"**, **"Build a Railroad"**, **"Create a Farm"**) distinct from the Sevopedia Improvements and a dedicated Builds page. Also added them to **Sevopedia Index** as **clickable entires with buttons**. See [Sevopedia reworks (Builds)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Sevopedia_Reworks.md#example-040-builds-eg-remove-jungle-build-road-create-a-farm).
